<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said analyst Scott Randall raised his earnings estimates on Intel Corp for fiscal 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 estimate to $9.08 per share from $8.75.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1998 estimate to $10.75 per share from $10.60.</p>
<p>-- Kept short- and long-term ratings as buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3-1/2 to 130-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
